*.swp

# Test output
coverage/

# Walkthrough build products.
#
# `docs/walkthrough/web/*.jpg` IS committed — it is what the Markdown shows and
# it is only ~700 kB. These two are not: the PNGs are 4 MB of archival
# originals, and the HTML page is another megabyte of the same images inlined as
# base64. Both regenerate with `npm run walkthrough`.
docs/walkthrough/shots/
docs/walkthrough/walkthrough.html
